WEBVTT

16:05.199 --> 16:07.243
into one.

16:11.247 --> 16:14.083
What happened to the skulls?

16:16.126 --> 16:17.670
I don't know.

16:17.795 --> 16:21.048
The Usurper had them
smashed to powder, I expect.

16:22.007 --> 16:24.009
Scattered to the wind.

16:27.221 --> 16:30.891
- That's very sad.
- Yes, it is.
